{"id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","title":"Abelian Categories and Exact Pairs","display":"df-abelian-category — Abelian Categories and Exact Pairs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-abelian-category","aliases":["58-df-abelian-category"],"display":"df-abelian-category — Abelian Categories and Exact Pairs","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-abelian-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-abelian-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abelian-category — Abelian Categories and Exact Pairs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,A,X,Y,Z,P,f,g,k,q,i,u,v,p,\\mathfrak a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,A,X,Y,Z,P,f,g,k,q,i,u,v,p,\\mathfrak a\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\">\\(s(f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(f)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\">\\(t(f)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\">\\(gf=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_X=\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\">\\(1_X=\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\)</span> 均是内部依赖所定义的取值记号，受 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 及所显示的源靶条件约束。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S\\)</span> 为二元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S,\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S,\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S,\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S,\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S,\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S,\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S,\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S,\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImageFactorizationIn}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ImageFactorizationIn}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V\\)</span> 是下述等价接口，不再是未解释的原语。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land Z\\in O\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,X)\\;(f=f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land Z\\in O\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,X)\\;(f=f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land Z\\in O\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Z)\\;(f=f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land Z\\in O\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Z)\\;(f=f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}object}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{InitialObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{TerminalObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(f,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X,Y\\in O\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\n\\land\\exists Z\\in O\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Z)\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,Y)\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land f=vu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}arrow}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(f,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X,Y\\in O\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\n\\land\\exists Z\\in O\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Z)\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,Y)\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land f=vu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(f))\\;(fu=fv\\to u=v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(f))\\;(fu=fv\\to u=v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}epimorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),X)\\;(uf=vf\\to u=v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}epimorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),X)\\;(uf=vf\\to u=v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),s(f))\\;(gf=1_{s(f)}\\land fg=1_{t(f)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in M\\land\n\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),s(f))\\;(gf=1_{s(f)}\\land fg=1_{t(f)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphic\\text{-}objects}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X,Y\\in O\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphic\\text{-}objects}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X,Y\\in O\\land\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land k,f\\in M\\land t(k)=s(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(fk,s(k),t(f),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(f))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(fu,X,t(f),\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(k))\\;(kv=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land k,f\\in M\\land t(k)=s(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(fk,s(k),t(f),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in O\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(f))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(fu,X,t(f),\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,s(k))\\;(kv=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}cokernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land q,f\\in M\\land s(q)=t(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(qf,s(f),t(q),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in O\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),Y)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(uf,s(f),Y,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q),Y)\\;(vq=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}cokernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land q,f\\in M\\land s(q)=t(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(qf,s(f),t(q),\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in O\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),Y)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(uf,s(f),Y,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q),Y)\\;(vq=u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}binary\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S(P,p,q,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P,X,Y\\in O\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,X)\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,X)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,Y)\\;\n\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,P)\\;(pu=f\\land qu=g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}binary\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S(P,p,q,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P,X,Y\\in O\n\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,X)\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,X)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,Y)\\;\n\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,P)\\;(pu=f\\land qu=g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom\\text{-}addition\\text{-}data}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak a,O\\times O,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in O\\;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\bigl(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y),\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in O\\;\\forall f,f&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\n\\forall g,g&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,Z)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad g\\,\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)(\\langle f,f&#39;\\rangle)\n=\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Z\\rangle)(\\langle gf,gf&#39;\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathfrak a(\\langle Y,Z\\rangle)(\\langle g,g&#39;\\rangle)\\,f\n=\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Z\\rangle)(\\langle gf,g&#39;f\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom\\text{-}addition\\text{-}data}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak a,O\\times O,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in O\\;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\bigl(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y),\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in O\\;\\forall f,f&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\n\\forall g,g&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,Z)\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad g\\,\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)(\\langle f,f&#39;\\rangle)\n=\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Z\\rangle)(\\langle gf,gf&#39;\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathfrak a(\\langle Y,Z\\rangle)(\\langle g,g&#39;\\rangle)\\,f\n=\\mathfrak a(\\langle X,Z\\rangle)(\\langle gf,g&#39;f\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\exists Z\\in O\\;\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in O\\;\\exists P\\in O\\;\\exists p,q\\in M\\;\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S(P,p,q,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\\exists k,q\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,f,\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land(\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak a\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HomAdditionData}_S(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\exists Z\\in O\\;\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in O\\;\\exists P\\in O\\;\\exists p,q\\in M\\;\\mathrm{BinaryProductIn}_S(P,p,q,X,Y,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\\exists k,q\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k,f,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q,f,\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{MonomorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land(\\mathrm{EpimorphismIn}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\to\\exists g\\in M\\;\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}category\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}category\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}image\\text{-}factorization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ImageFactorizationIn}_S(i,u,f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land i,u,f\\in M\n\\l